what_shipped_13c0569:
  fix(audit): immutable audit log + rate limits on HR-decision endpoints
  P1 — 5 endpoints now write to hash-chained AuditLogEntry:
    leave.approve_application      → leave.approved
    leave.reject_application       → leave.rejected
    attendance.approve_timesheet   → timesheet.approved
    attendance.reject_timesheet    → timesheet.rejected
    appraisals.manager_review      → appraisal.manager_reviewed
  P2 — Rate limits (60/60s per actor) on leave + timesheet
       approve/reject (claims + appraisals.manager_review were
       already rate-limited).

